dirname   : /home/ann/docs
basename  : report.final.txt
extension : .txt
stem      : report.final
absolute  : 1, relative: 0
dirname("file.txt")   = .
dirname("/file.txt")  = /
extension(".bashrc")  = "" (a leading dot is not an extension)
extension("README")   = ""
basename("a/b/")      = b (a trailing slash is ignored)
stem("a.tar.gz")      = a.tar
Windows name: basename x.csv, absolute 1
